        }\n\n        .headshot-container {\n            min-height:300px;\n        }\n\n        .headshot {\n            max-height:300px;\n        }\n\n\n        .talk-title {\n          font-size: 16px;\n          line-height: 1.5;\n          margin-bottom: 10px;\n          max-width:300px;\n          margin-left:auto;\n          margin-right:auto;          \n        }\n\n        .talk-abstract {\n          font-style: italic;\n          font-size: 14px;\n          margin-bottom: 10px;\n          max-width:300px;\n          margin-left:auto;\n          margin-right:auto;\n        }\n\n        .speaker img {\n          max-width: 100%;\n          height: auto;\n        }\n\n        .social-icons {\n          margin-top: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .social-icons a {\n          margin-right: 10px;\n          font-size: 18px;\n          color: #b00999;\n          text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .speaker-sep {\n            size:1;\n            border-color: #b00999;\n        }\n\n        .hidden {\n            display:none;\n        }\n\n        .logo-container {\n            min-width:300px;\n        }\n\n        .supporter-logo {\n            max-width:300px;\n        }\n\n        .popout > a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n\n\n    </style>\n\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"previous-event\">You're viewing a previous event, <a href=\"/\">click here for this year's conference!</a></div>\n    <!-- Hero section -->\n    <header class=\"text-white bg-purple p-5\">\n        <div class=\"container text-center\">\n            <h1 class=\"popout\"><a href=\"/\">Flower City AI</a></h1>\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">Wednesday, December 6 - The Little Theatre</h2>\n            <p class=\"lead\">Come participate with Rochester's growth into a leading area for AI innovation, education, healthcare, art, business, and research.</p>\n            <p class=\"lead\">Don't miss this unique opportunity to network, learn, and drive innovation in your community.</p>\n            <p class=\"lead text-center\"><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/flower-city-ai-2025-tickets-1414207686259\" class=\"btn btn-white\">Get Tickets</a></p>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light\">\n        <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n            <button class=\"navbar-toggler justify-content-center mx-auto\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarCentered\" aria-controls=\"navbarCentered\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\">\n                <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-center\" id=\"navbarCentered\">\n                <ul class=\"navbar-nav mb-2 mb-lg-0\">\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#Agenda\">Agenda</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#Tickets\">Tickets</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#Speakers\">Speakers</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#map\">Map</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#parking\">Parking</a>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Schedule -->\n    <section class=\"container py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container\">            \n            <a name=\"Agenda\"></a>\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">Agenda</h2>\n            <table class=\"table table-responsive\">\n                <tbody>\n\n                    <!-- Registration -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Registration<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">8AM-9AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n                                <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-title\">Coffee and Networking</div>\n                                    <div class=\"more-link\">Meet in the lobby of Theater #1, get registered, enjoy some coffee, and meet your fellow attendees.</div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <!-- Morning -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Morning<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">9AM-9:40AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Keynote: Flower City AI</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Max Irwin &amp; Evan Dawson</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">9:45AM-10:20AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">SAPIEN Chat</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Masum Hasan</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\">We are building a platform of virtual humans backed by state-of-the-art Large Language Models and Com<strong>...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">We are building a platform of virtual humans backed by state-of-the-art Large Language Models and Computer Vision systems, that will allow you to have highly realistic interactions with virtual humans in a way that has never been possible before.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <!-- Morning Break -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-break\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\"></span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">15 minute break</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">10:40AM-11:15AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Tympana for No-Code Data-Centric AI</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Paul Yacci &amp; Allison Yacci</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\">Tympana, a powerful web-based platform that brings Machine Learning tools to the hands of the domain <strong>...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Tympana, a powerful web-based platform that brings Machine Learning tools to the hands of the domain experts. Tympana assists scientists in building high quality Machine Learning models for their complex data, allowing them to scale their expertise and serving as a multiplier in efforts. Designed to be user friendly, Tympana requires no programming or coding skills on the part of the user. Tympana integrates active learning, explainable AI, and generative AI to create robust models and datasets that can be exported for scientific workflows. Tympana currently has proof-of-concept use cases, in Protein Sequences, Image Object Detection and Sensor Signal detection. These use cases serve to demonstrate the capabilities of the Tympana platform. The active learning strategies utilized by Tympana have demonstrated a reduction in data volume requirements in initial experiments that will save scientists time in achieving comparable results. While it can be easy to instruct users at diverse education levels how to recognize a specific object within an image, it requires years of training to properly evaluate a sensor reading from a DNA sequencer, an X-ray, CT scan, or a particle accelerator. These domains require an inherent body of knowledge and experience that does not lend itself to annotation by the general public. Tympana enables scientists to comb through large volumes of data and teach the computer what features are important, putting scientists in the driver seat of their own analysis.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">11:20AM-11:55AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Building an AI Community with Ruby</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Landon Gray</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\">Have you ever considered building a machine learning model in Ruby? It may surprise you to learn that<strong>...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Have you ever considered building a machine learning model in Ruby? It may surprise you to learn that you can train, build, and deploy ML models in Ruby. But what are the benefits of using Ruby over other languages?  In this talk, we'll walk through the process of building a simple ML model in Ruby that predicts the weather, and we will explore some of the various tools and libraries used.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <!-- Lunch -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Lunch<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">12PM-1PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n                                <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-title\">Lunch will be provided</div>\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Along with more networking!</div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <!-- Afternoon -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Afternoon<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">1:05PM-1:40PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Racing Towards Responsibility: Why AI Developers Must Lead on Ethics</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Mark Weber</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\">As AI rapidly advances, developers must swiftly implement ethical frameworks, rather than wait for go<strong>...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">As AI rapidly advances, developers must swiftly implement ethical frameworks, rather than wait for government regulation. This talk will provide examples of major tech companies facing backlash over AI's failures, from perpetuating historical biases that harm marginalized groups to enabling Deep Fakes that threaten stability. Growing concern exists that complex black-box algorithms have become difficult for even creators to control. While long-term solutions require industry, government, and society coordination, developers have tools today to mitigate harm. Internally, companies need personnel to steer teams toward ethical objectives. Externally, the industry should adopt corporate social responsibility policies. The message is clear: AI developers must lead on ethics before public trust is irreparably damaged.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">1:45PM-2:20PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Revolutionizing Healthcare Spending: A Predictive Approach to the Patient Journey</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Jeffrey McCormack</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\">Iryss is building a platform to automate how patients plan, save, and pay for healthcare, by guiding <strong>...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Iryss is building a platform to automate how patients plan, save, and pay for healthcare, by guiding them to cost-saving opportunities and tailoring payment strategies to ensure financial security. Leveraging his professional and personal experience, Jeff is leading a team that is passionate about making an impact on patients' lives. Iryss is headquartered in Rochester, NY.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <!-- Afternoon Break -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-break\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\"></span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">15 minute break</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">2:40PM-3:15PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Prompting Positivity</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Chris Cooley</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\">Chris will discuss an innovative approach at the intersection of AI technology and creative storytell<strong>...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Chris will discuss an innovative approach at the intersection of AI technology and creative storytelling. He will highlight a unique initiative to craft comic books inspired by real people and their life experiences. The talk will showcase how the company empowers individuals to confront their fears and transform vulnerabilities into strengths using AI tools. By exploring these compelling stories, the presentation will illustrate the transformative potential of creative cultures and demonstrate how AI-driven creativity can be harnessed to uplift individuals and communities.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">3:20PM-3:55PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">AI in Cancer Care: Enhancing Precision Medicine</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Abbas Rizvi</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\">Join Abbas in exploring AI's transformative impact on precision medicine in oncology. Discover how in<strong>...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Join Abbas in exploring AI's transformative impact on precision medicine in oncology. Discover how integrating AI with real-world data is revolutionizing cancer care. This talk will highlight AI's role in genetic sequencing, digital pathology, and translational science, enhancing personalized treatment and accelerating biopharmaceutical development. Additionally, we'll discuss the wider industry's innovative contributions to this field.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <!-- Music Setup -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-break\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\"></span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">10 minute break</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">4:10PM-4:45PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Bridging the gap with Music and AI</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">L. è D</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\">L. é D is a multi-talented vocalist, and rapper, guitar player and dancer. She dubs herself a creativ<strong>...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">L. é D is a multi-talented vocalist, and rapper, guitar player and dancer. She dubs herself a creative entrepreneur. She was born in Bansoh, Cameroon.  At the age of 6 her family moved to the United States and she was raised in PG County MD where she lived until she moved to Rochester In 2021 in search of identity and self she quickly realized she’d found home. In the past 2 years that she has been here she has dedicated herself to contributing to and creating safe spaces for people to connect and be vulnerable, to have hard conversations and find community, to be and to become. She has partnered with institutions like Community justice initiative, Avenue Blackbox theater and Beamhouse nation to spread a message of inclusion, acceptance and self empowerment. She is dedicated to creating and fostering more safe spaces for people to be their truest and freest self in hopes of giving back to the city where she found her truest and freest self. With the rise of AI and language model based chatbots she found that she could use artificial intelligence to bridge the resource gap between independent artists like her self, and multi million dollar creatives.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">4:50PM-5:00PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Closing Remarks</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Max Irwin</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Evening<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">5PM-7PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n                                <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-title\">After Party</div>\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Sponsored by StartupGrind</div>\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p>Fattey Beer Company, 60 Adventure Pl, Rochester, NY 14607</p></div>\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            \n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"text-white bg-purple p-5\">\n        <div class=\"container text-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">Wednesday December 6th</h2>\n            <h3 class=\"text-center\">Today!</h3>\n            <!--\n            <br >\n            <div id=\"countdown\" class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <h1 id=\"days\"></h1>\n                    <div>Days</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <h1 id=\"hours\"></h1>\n                    <div>Hours</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <h1 id=\"minutes\"></h1>\n                    <div>Minutes</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <h1 id=\"seconds\"></h1>\n                    <div>Seconds</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            -->\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Purchase Tickets -->\n    <section class=\"container py-5\">\n        <a name=\"Tickets\"></a>\n        <h2 class=\"text-center\">Tickets now available</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead text-center\"><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/flower-city-ai-2025-tickets-1414207686259\" class=\"btn btn-purple\">Get Tickets</a></p>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n                <p>Early Bird Ticket Price: $40</p>\n                <p>Students with a valid ID attend free</p>\n                <p><em>This is a not-for-profit conference.  100% of ticket sales go to cover the cost of the event.</em></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Speakers -->\n    <section class=\"text-white bg-purple p-5\">\n        <div class=\"container text-center\">\n          <a name=\"Speakers\"></a>\n          <h2 class=\"text-center\">Speakers/Performers</h2>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <!-- 1 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-max-irwin.jpg\" alt=\"Max Irwin\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Max Irwin</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Keynote</strong></em></p>\n                <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Max is the founder of MAX.IO LLC, an AI Knowledge Discovery business, and the organizer of Flower City AI.  As Chief Everything Officer, he builds and sells AI products to businesses that need predictable and scalable solutions. We develop state of the art model serving inference software, train models, and help companies incorporate AI in their customer facing products.</p>\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://max.io\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/maxirwin/\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 2 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-masum-hasan.jpg\" alt=\"Masum Hasan\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Masum Hasan</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>SAPIEN</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Masum is a PhD student in Computer Science at the University of Rochester and Co-founder of SAPIEN Coach. He has been working on Natural Language Processing and Langauge Models for more than 5 years. Currently, he and his team are building a general-purpose virtual-human API backed by Large Language Models that aims to redefine customer service, education, and entertainment.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://masumhasan.net/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                    <!-- <a href=\"https://sapien.coach\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a> -->\n                    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/masum6/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 3 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-led.jpg\" alt=\"L. è D photo\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>L. è D</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Music</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">L. é D is a multi-talented vocalist, and rapper, guitar player and dancer. She dubs herself a creative entrepreneur. She was born in Bansoh, Cameroon.  With the rise of AI and language model based chatbots she found that she could use artificial intelligence to bridge the resource gap between independent artists like her self, and multi million dollar creatives.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaT3jCMebr7gdCvqtCKGAHw\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-youtube\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/theled__/\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-instagram\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 4 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-chris-cooley.jpg\" alt=\"Chris Cooley photo\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Chris Cooley</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Prompting Positivity</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Chris Cooley, the visionary CEO of Cooley Comics, LLC, is a renowned visual storyteller, artist, and community builder. With a passion for AI technology and a keen eye for creative solutions, he stands as an investor and enthusiast in the field. Chris empowers individuals to embrace their inner strengths by helping them explore their truths, promoting positivity, and fostering mindfulness in the present moment.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://promptingpositivity.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/chriscooley/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 5 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-jeff-mccormack.jpg\" alt=\"Jeff McCormack photo\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Jeff McCormack</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Iryss</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Jeff embarked on his entrepreneurial journey in 2021, backed by a rich background in financial services and technology. Mid-career Jeff transitioned from managing billion-dollar portfolios as a buy-side healthcare equity analyst to steering innovative AI projects. Jeff initially led the product team at an AI-powered intellectual property search engine, demonstrating his ability to communicate from the lab to the C-suite. He was then recruited to lead product development on the development of a revolutionary universal operating system for industrial robots.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://iryss.finance/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>            \n\n            <!-- 6 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-landon-gray.jpg\" alt=\"Landon Gray photo\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Landon Gray</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Building an AI Developer Community</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Landon Gray is an empathy-driven problem solver and software consultant working at Test Double, a Software Consultancy.  In his free time, Landon pursues learning about and implementing AI use cases in the Ruby programming language. Landon enjoys bringing together people and recently founded a community called Ruby AI, which has a following of almost 300 engineers and technologists interested in building AI applications in Ruby.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/thedayisntgray/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/i/communities/1709211359039078677\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-twitter\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 7 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-mark-weber.jpg\" alt=\"Mark Weber photo placeholder\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Mark Weber</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Business and Innovation</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">An expert in international business, Weber was an executive for two corporations selling lead-edge technology around the world.   He has earned multiple honors for student mentoring at Nazareth University.  Weber co-developed and is the director of the Business, Artificial Intelligence, and Innovation (B.S.) major.   He received his received his bachelor's degree in marketing and advertising from Ohio University and a master's degree in business administration from the University of Dayton.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www2.naz.edu/academics/business-leadership-degree-program\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div> \n\n            <!-- 8 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-abbas-rizvi.jpg\" alt=\"Abbas Rizvi photo\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Abbas Rizvi</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Tempus</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Abbas is passionate about leveraging real-world data in oncology to drive advancements in precision medicine. Expert in multimodal datasets analysis, including genomics, clinical information, and medical imaging. Skilled in implementing machine learning techniques to extract valuable insights.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.tempus.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 9 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-paul-yacci.jpg\" alt=\"Paul Yacci photo\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Paul Yacci</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Tympana</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Paul Yacci is Co-founder and CTO of DataCicada. He has over 15 years of Machine Learning, Artificial Intelligence, Software Development and Data Analytics. He has served as the leading developer and visionary for Tympana. He has successfully deployed software for the Federal Government while working as a consultant at Booz Allen Hamilton. Paul also served as Director of Data Science at ITT Gould's Pumps and is Adjunct Faculty at RIT in the college of computing. He is a co-author of the book, “Field Guide to Data Science,” and several research papers. He holds Masters Degrees in Computer Science (George Mason University) and Bioinformatics (Rochester Institute of Technology) and a Bachelors in Biotechnology from RIT.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tympana.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 10 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-allison-yacci.jpg\" alt=\"Allison Yacci photo\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Allison Yacci</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Tympana</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Allison Yacci is Co-founder and CEO of DataCicada. She is a serial entrepreneur that has run 5 prior companies. Allison is hands on with all aspects of DataCicada and is responsible for the management of business operations at DataCicada. She has a Masters of Business Administration (MBA) degree with dual concentrations in Finance and Entrepreneurship and a Bachelors of Science degree in Biotechnology from the Rochester Institute of Technology.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tympana.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 11 -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-6 speaker\">\n              <hr class=\"speaker-separator\">\n              <div class=\"headshot-container\"><img src=\"/img/headshot-evan-dawson.webp\" alt=\"Evan Dawson photo\" class=\"img-responsive img-circle headshot\"></div>\n              <h3>Evan Dawson</h3>\n              <div class=\"talk-detail\">\n                  <p class=\"talk-title\"><em><strong>Emcee</strong></em></p>\n                  <p class=\"talk-abstract\">Our Emcee for the day - Evan Dawson is the host of \"Connections with Evan Dawson.\" He joined WXXI in January 2014 after working at 13WHAM-TV, where he served as morning news anchor. He was hired as a reporter for 13WHAM-TV in 2003 before being promoted to anchor in 2007.</p>\n\n                  <div class=\"social-icons\">\n                    <a href=\"https://www.wxxinews.org/show/connections\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-globe\"></i></a>\n                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/evandawson\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-sm\"><i class=\"bi bi-twitter\"></i></a>\n                  </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>          \n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    \n    <!-- OpenStreetMap Section -->\n    <section class=\"container py-5\">\n        <a name=\"map\"></a>\n        <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <h2>Conference Location</h2>\n            <p class=\"lead\">The Little Theater<br>240 East Ave<br>Rochester, NY 14604</p>\n            <p class=\"lead text-center\"><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/flower-city-ai-2025-tickets-1414207686259\" class=\"btn btn-purple\">Get Tickets</a></p>\n            <div id=\"mapid\" style=\"height: 400px; position: relative;\" class=\"leaflet-container leaflet-touch leaflet-retina leaflet-fade-anim leaflet-grab leaflet-touch-drag leaflet-touch-zoom\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"leaflet-pane leaflet-map-pane\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\"><div class=\"leaflet-pane leaflet-tile-pane\"><div class=\"leaflet-layer \" style=\"z-index: 1; opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"leaflet-tile-container leaflet-zoom-animated\" style=\"z-index: 19; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale(1);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://b.tile.openstreetmap.org/11/582/751.png\" class=\"leaflet-tile leaflet-tile-loaded\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 256px; transform: translate3d(416px, 118px, 0px); opacity: 0.005;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://a.tile.openstreetmap.org/11/582/750.png\" class=\"leaflet-tile leaflet-tile-loaded\" style=\"width: 256